From: Project Luma
Subject: [PATCH] Luma Grid: sharp full-resolution previews, no enlarging, no
 layout-pass side effects

Previews are rendered at the window's own resolution and shrunk with a 4x4
box filter instead of one bilinear lookup; a preview is never drawn larger
than its window; card placement and restyling happen outside Clutter's layout
pass; off-row cards fade where their window is instead of flying across other
displays; Grid logs its cards when it opens and warns if one does not settle.
